 "content": [
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "I was super excited to find out you made a gallery, but it just loads forever for me. I've even tried different browsers, disabling adblock, the works. Weird as it is to say, I hope it's a problem with the site and not my computer because between you and me you're the only one skilled enough to fix it and you definitely can't fix my computer."
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Well."
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "I don't THINK you're that kind of wizard, at least"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "dw dw anon! fortunately it's (mostly likely) not ur computer! trying to get the gallery working across the board has been a tricky back and forth between me being a lazy dick (refusing to pay for a server + refusing to learn docker/react/vue) and balancing the amount of image files I'm trying to shove into the page (via cloudflare r2 objects (bruh)) 😭 so it was bound to break at some point"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "i'll probably roll the method i'm using back to a slightly less performant but consistently working version until i can confirm it works 100% of the time :] ty for letting me know anon!!"
  }
 ],
